{"id":"vod_jy_90295","vodId":"90295","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"进击的巨人第三季合集","name_cn":"进击的巨人第三季合集","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第22集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/3f16df3165aeb4df25222b804214ca97.jpg"},"summary":"历经百年的时光，将人类与外侧世界隔开的墙壁。在墙壁的另一侧，似乎有前所未见的世界延伸开来。火焰之水、冰之大地、砂之雪原……记载在书中的，尽是些激发少年探究心的文字。在时间流转，墙壁被巨人毁坏的现在，人类正一步步接近世界的真相。巨人的真实身份是什么？为何墙壁中会埋着巨人？巨人化的艾伦·耶格尔所持有的“坐标”之力是？以及，西斯托利亚·雷斯究竟知道这个世界的什么事情？在艾伦等104期兵的加入下，建立新体制的利威尔班。最强最恶的敌人，阻拦在开始行动的他们面前。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-11-21 13:45:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Pe9m6lBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJRDVPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/kazoP2mb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWROZQa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dByoxkb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7k8lye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3GR4Oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmPRA9a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbq9RJGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9avkqN0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkPQzEd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdR7YWOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNRDNDd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ZdP8m2Wd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeEBllYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negP55Ga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbYR66Md/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https:/